# Business Analysis Excellence Rule

Every non-trivial module must have analysis that is testable, traceable, and implementation-ready.

Required BA outputs:
- Use-case catalog (happy path, alternate path, exception path).
- Business rule matrix (`condition -> action -> outcome`).
- Data contract matrix (field semantics, validation, ownership, source of truth).
- Acceptance criteria with explicit pass/fail evidence.
- Traceability map from requirement -> implementation -> test.

Execution standards:
- No ambiguous terms without operational definition.
- Every validation/error branch must have deterministic behavior.
- Every handoff from BA to Dev/QA must include entry/exit criteria.
